  "instructions": [
    "Heat the fondue pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the vegetable oil and saut\u00131 the chopped onion until translucent.",
    "Add the sliced ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb shoulder and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, paprika, salt, black pepper, and cayenne pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the harissa and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the dashi extract, beef broth, water, red wine, and tomato paste.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 1 1/2 hours.",
    "Shred the lamb with two forks and return it to the pot.",
    "Stir in the garlic granules and cook for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro if desired.",
    "To assemble the fondue, place the shredded lamb in the fondue pot and serve with bread or crackers for dipping."
  ],
